# Keep the build context lean + never ship host artefacts into the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
docs
*.md
!apps/dfe-core-ui/README.md
# Untracked is not un-copied: Next loads apps/dfe-core-ui/.env.local in the
# builder and inlines every NEXT_PUBLIC_* value into the client bundle.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.example.*
